<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="572763271"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1413454003"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="U Make Me (Asketa &amp; Natan Chaim Remix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Disco Fries / Raquel Castro / Asketa &amp; Natan Chaim"/><amll:meta key="album" value="U Make Me (Remixes)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:17.410"><div begin="00:00.740" end="02:17.410"><p begin="00:00.740" end="00:04.650" itunes:key="L1">Broke up bond, said you regret it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关系破裂 你说后悔了</span></p><p begin="00:04.650" end="00:08.420" itunes:key="L2">I took you back so we could mend it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我让你回来 和你重归旧好</span></p><p begin="00:08.420" end="00:11.560" itunes:key="L3">Said you're sorry for the damage<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你很抱歉对我造成了伤害</span></p><p begin="00:11.560" end="00:11.980" itunes:key="L4">And you'll pick up the pieces<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会收拾残局</span></p><p begin="00:11.980" end="00:15.530" itunes:key="L5">Put out puzzle back together<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们破镜重圆</span></p><p begin="00:15.530" end="00:18.770" itunes:key="L6">There's a storm inside, lightin' up my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中卷起风暴 让我骤然清醒</span></p><p begin="00:18.770" end="00:22.950" itunes:key="L7">Oh, ya did me wrong, but ya feel so right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你伤害了我 可你不觉得难过</span></p><p begin="00:22.950" end="00:26.590" itunes:key="L8">There's a voice inside, tryna change my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心有个声音 劝我改变主意</span></p><p begin="00:26.590" end="00:29.020" itunes:key="L9">Yeah, ya did me wrong, but<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你伤害了我 但是</span></p><p begin="00:29.020" end="00:31.060" itunes:key="L10">Oh, you make me, oh you make me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我 你让我</span></p><p begin="00:31.060" end="00:34.670" itunes:key="L11">Feel so alive, like ridin' giant waves<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉如此振奋 仿佛乘风破浪</span></p><p begin="00:34.670" end="00:38.060" itunes:key="L12">Through our paradise like kissin' in the rain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫步天堂之上 就像在雨中亲吻</span></p><p begin="00:38.060" end="00:39.970" itunes:key="L13">Yes, when I'm with you, no, I can't deny<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 当我和你在一起 我无法抵抗</span></p><p begin="00:39.970" end="00:41.910" itunes:key="L14">Your love got me hooked and I'm high tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的爱让我入迷 今晚我兴奋异常</span></p><p begin="00:41.910" end="00:43.870" itunes:key="L15">I feel so alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉如此振奋</span></p><p begin="00:43.870" end="01:00.430" itunes:key="L16">Oh, you make me, oh you make-<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我 你让我</span></p><p begin="01:00.430" end="01:01.280" itunes:key="L17">Oh, you make me-<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我</span></p><p begin="01:17.310" end="01:20.680" itunes:key="L18">Feelin' guarded, I can't help it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时刻警戒 我情不自禁</span></p><p begin="01:20.680" end="01:24.360" itunes:key="L19">I'm a little scared, but is that selfish?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我有点害怕 但那是不是很自私</span></p><p begin="01:24.360" end="01:27.830" itunes:key="L20">'Cause if all is fair, in love and war then<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为如果这场相爱相杀没有不公</span></p><p begin="01:27.830" end="01:31.200" itunes:key="L21">Let's call it even, there's no time for second guessin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那咱们就算扯平了 没时间过多地猜疑</span></p><p begin="01:31.200" end="01:35.060" itunes:key="L22">There's a storm inside lightin' up my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中的风暴 让我骤然清醒</span></p><p begin="01:35.060" end="01:38.710" itunes:key="L23">Oh, ya did me wrong, but ya feel so right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你伤害了我 可你不觉得难过</span></p><p begin="01:38.710" end="01:42.570" itunes:key="L24">There's a voice inside, tryna change my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心的声音 劝我改变主意</span></p><p begin="01:42.570" end="01:45.010" itunes:key="L25">Yeah, ya did me wrong, but<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你伤害了我 可是</span></p><p begin="01:45.010" end="01:46.970" itunes:key="L26">Oh, you make me, oh you make me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我 你让我</span></p><p begin="01:46.970" end="01:50.590" itunes:key="L27">Feel so alive like ridin' giant waves<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉如此振奋 仿佛乘风破浪</span></p><p begin="01:50.590" end="01:54.500" itunes:key="L28">Through our paradise like kissin' in the rain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫步天堂之上 就像在雨中亲吻</span></p><p begin="01:54.500" end="01:56.170" itunes:key="L29">Yes, when I'm with you, no, I can't deny<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 当我和你在一起 我无法抵抗</span></p><p begin="01:56.170" end="01:58.010" itunes:key="L30">Your love got me hooked and I'm high tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的爱让我入迷 今晚我兴奋异常</span></p><p begin="01:58.010" end="02:00.030" itunes:key="L31">I feel so alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉如此振奋</span></p><p begin="02:00.030" end="02:16.310" itunes:key="L32">Oh, you make me, oh you make-<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我 你让我</span></p><p begin="02:16.310" end="02:17.410" itunes:key="L33">Oh, you make me-<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我</span></p></div></body></tt>